@ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5083

### Health Check
GET {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Calculate Quote - Basic
POST {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 42,
  "status": "SalariedEmployee",
  "familyOption": true,
  "accidentOption": false,
  "seniorityMonths": 36
}

###

### Calculate Quote - Household Employer
POST {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 55,
  "status": "HouseholdEmployer",
  "familyOption": false,
  "accidentOption": true,
  "seniorityMonths": 12
}

###

### Calculate Quote - Complex Scenario
POST {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 70,
  "status": "HouseholdEmployer",
  "familyOption": true,
  "accidentOption": true,
  "seniorityMonths": 30
}

###

### Calculate Quote - Invalid Age (should return 400)
POST {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 17,
  "status": "SalariedEmployee",
  "familyOption": false,
  "accidentOption": false,
  "seniorityMonths": 0
}

###

### Reset Database (requires admin token)
POST {{ContosoProtect.Api_HostAddress}}/admin/reset
X-Admin-Token: demo-reset

###

